## Why This Is Asked

Evaluates ability to design an offline-first map data model, incremental sync, and scalable UI rendering with clustering in a real RN app.

## Key Concepts

- Offline-first data model using WatermelonDB or Realm
- Disk tile cache for maps
- Incremental sync with delta PUSH and server updates
- Conflict resolution via server-timestamp precedence or last-writer-wins with logs
- Marker clustering with geohash or grid
- Testing: offline edits, conflict scenarios, clustering accuracy, cache eviction

